# NewLeaf System — Pipeline Schedulers
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Times are in London (BST/GMT). 14:00 London = 9:00am ET.
#
# Jobs:
#   1. Fast pipeline (intraday): every 15 min during market hours
#   2. OI enrichment (daily): 9:32am ET = 14:32 London
#   3. Watchlist pipeline (daily): 9:35am ET = 14:35 London
#   4. Health check: every 5 min
#
# To enable:  ./start.sh
# To disable: ./stop.sh
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# NewLeaf System — Intraday fast pipeline (Alpaca only, every 15 min, 9am-4pm ET Mon-Fri)
*/15 14-21 * * 1-5 cd /Users/manish/dev/newleafsystem/scanner && /Users/manish/.nvm/versions/node/v20.19.5/bin/node pipeline-fast.js --watchlist >> /tmp/newleaf-fast-pipeline.log 2>&1

# NewLeaf System — Daily catch-up (OI + watchlist + sync, runs every 15 min but only executes once/day)
# Uses marker files so it never misses even if Mac was asleep at the original fixed time
*/15 14-21 * * 1-5 cd /Users/manish/dev/newleafsystem/scanner && /bin/bash run-daily-catchup.sh

# NewLeaf System — Update pick outcomes (6pm ET = 23:00 London BST, Mon-Fri)
0 23 * * 1-5 cd /Users/manish/dev/newleafsystem && /Users/manish/.nvm/versions/node/v20.19.5/bin/node scripts/update-pick-outcomes.js >> /tmp/newleaf-pick-outcomes.log 2>&1

# NewLeaf System — Weekly picks email (Sunday 6pm ET = 23:00 London BST)
0 23 * * 0 cd /Users/manish/dev/newleafsystem && /Users/manish/.nvm/versions/node/v20.19.5/bin/node pipeline/send-weekly-email.js >> /tmp/newleaf-weekly-email.log 2>&1

# NewLeaf System — Health check (every 5 min)
*/5 * * * * cd /Users/manish/dev/newleafsystem/scanner && /bin/bash check-scheduler-health.sh >> /tmp/newleaf-health.log 2>&1
